.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-pack
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
apps/python/config/*
!apps/python/config/*.example
apps/python/input
apps/python/output
apps/python/log
input
output
log
packages/brief-lens/dist
docs
